<!-- UR3 arm, generated by scripts/convert_ur3_usd_to_mjcf.py from usd/robots/ur3/ur3.usd
     Fixed base (USD root_joint). Joint order: shoulder_pan_joint, shoulder_lift_joint, elbow_joint, wrist_1_joint, wrist_2_joint, wrist_3_joint.
     Actuators = position PD, tuned for MuJoCo (USD drive values kept in comments): real UR3 torque limits,
     joint damping capping speed near the real limits, no overshoot, gravity compensated through the actuators.
     Self-collision off, as in USD (enabledSelfCollisions = False).
     Not from USD: armature 0.01 on wrist joints (MuJoCo stability at dt = 2 ms; PhysX drives are implicit).
     Collision: CoACD convex pieces of the USD collision meshes (USD uses PhysX convexDecomposition). -->
